                    <th style="padding-top: 12px;padding-bottom: 12px;text-align: left;background-color: #5574a7;color: white; text-align: center;">最低支出</th>
                    <th style="padding-top: 12px;padding-bottom: 12px;text-align: left;background-color: #5574a7;color: white; text-align: center;">最高支出</th>
